  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "地图、NPC和敌人全部随机生成，每个太吾世界都是一次全新的江湖历程。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "With completely randomly generated maps, NPCs, and enemies, each playthrough will be a brand-new adventure.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/838350/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "数千名NPC会衰老、生病和死亡，玩家可成家育子并把毕生武学传给下一代。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Thousands of NPCs, each with their own relationships and life experiences, will age, fall ill, and eventually die. You can form various kinds of relationships with them, even deciding their fate. You will marry and have children with your partner. You will cultivate and pass down your lifelong martial arts skills to the next heir.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/838350/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "招式相克、万物皆可为兵，武器长短与命中身体部位都会改变交锋结果。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "A unique combat system that restores the design of \"countering moves,\" \"using everything as a weapon,\" and \"the longer the blade, the stronger the strike, the shorter the blade, the more dangerous the gap.\" Every slash, sword strike, and palm will land on different parts of your enemy's body, creating a true-to-life combat experience.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/838350/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
